DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44845::$$$message_0394_0000_0000$$$::"Is this...Fuyuki's Holy Grail Onsen? It's more like..."::
44846::$$$message_0394_0000_0001$$$::"It's exactly like our Greater Grail, right? Did we just fall for a trap?"::
44847::$$$message_0394_0000_0002$$$::"No, we probably just took a wrong turn. I have a hunch we would be at the onsen now if we'd gone the other way at the fork."::
44848::$$$message_0394_0000_0003$$$::"Really? Archer, I know you have a great nose for money and treasure...but I'm pretty sure this is where the ticket says to go."::
44849::$$$message_0394_0000_0004$$$::"Let me see... [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=アーチャーprt face=笑顔 pos=right time=400 twno=1][hfsigh layer=1]Ah, I see. We certainly are on the right path."::
44850::$$$message_0394_0000_0005$$$::"But enough about us. Saber! This is only about you."::
44851::$$$message_0394_0000_0006$$$::"What? Why me?"::
44853::$$$message_0394_0000_0008$$$::"Mwahahaha! You still don't get it, you oaf!? This ticket isn't addressed to Ayaka!"::
44855::$$$message_0394_0000_0010$$$::"It's a love letter aimed squarely at you!"::
44856::$$$message_0394_0000_0011$$$::"Say what!? [wvl canskip=false time=150][wm canskip=0][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーprt face=哀 pos=left time=300 twno=2][hfsweat layer=0 ox=0 oy=0][hfangry layer=0][playstop time=1000 storage=bgm35.ogg]That means the person waiting for us is...!"::
44857::$$$message_0394_0000_0012$$$::"Saber! You finally came to see me!"::
44859::$$$message_0394_0000_0014$$$::"[line len=3]!!!"::
44860::$$$message_0394_0000_0015$$$::"Aww, you look so pale. You must be so happy to see me your cheeks are spasming..."::
44861::$$$message_0394_0000_0016$$$::"I knew you were my Prince Charming, Saber! [wvl][hfpop layer=1]I love you! I love you so much I'd trade every life on Earth to be with you!"::
44862::$$$message_0394_0000_0017$$$::"All right, let's bounce. Have fun, playboy."::
44863::$$$message_0394_0000_0018$$$::"Heh. Dropping out already? Time to pay the piper, Saber."::
44864::$$$message_0394_0000_0019$$$::(...)::
44865::$$$message_0394_0000_0020$$$::(Manaka Sajyou, my big sister of six years. She was also Saber's Master in the previous war, where she was pretty much invincible.)::
44866::$$$message_0394_0000_0021$$$::(I'd rather not talk about her, but to sum her up, she's a transcendentally gifted demon who won't die even when she's killed.)::
44867::$$$message_0394_0000_0022$$$::"Come here, Saber. I've prepared the most special bath ever for you."::
44868::$$$message_0394_0000_0023$$$::"Oh, would you like dinner first? Or...would you like [font italic=true]me[font italic=false] instead, just like last time with the Greater Grail?"::
44869::$$$message_0394_0000_0024$$$::"...Huh, you never told me about that, Saber. What happened between you and my sister in front of the Greater Grail?"::
44870::$$$message_0394_0000_0025$$$::"Th-this is all a misunderstanding! [wvl]You could say I backstabbed Manaka (with my sacred sword) when she was all twirly..."::
44871::$$$message_0394_0000_0026$$$::"Huh? Y-you stabbed her in the back!? Really!?"::
44872::$$$message_0394_0000_0027$$$::"That's right![heart] It was a once-in-a-lifetime, passionate embrace. So..."::
44873::$$$message_0394_0000_0028$$$::"I'll do the same for you, Saber. Not from behind, but all over every nook and cranny of your body."::
44874::$$$message_0394_0000_0029$$$::"Like a big wreath of flowers. No, like the sparkling stars in the sky. I'll caress you with my tentacles until you're all sparkly and slurpy.[heart]"::
44875::$$$message_0394_0000_0030$$$::"...Mrgh. That's not good, Manaka. I did betray you twice."::
44877::$$$message_0394_0000_0032$$$::"The first time was from behind. The second time was when I made a pact with Ayaka. So I'm prepared for you to take revenge."::
44878::$$$message_0394_0000_0033$$$::"Saber..."::
44879::$$$message_0394_0000_0034$$$::"Still, you should learn how to speak more like a heroine. A girl your age shouldn't be talking about tentacles, okay?[whitestar]"::
44880::$$$message_0394_0000_0035$$$::"Guh...!"::
44881::$$$message_0394_0000_0036$$$::"Saber...! Yes, I'll do my best! How about a romantic Manaka slaughter flogging!?"::
44882::$$$message_0394_0000_0037$$$::"...You know, I've been thinking this for a while, but maybe you and my sister were meant for each other."::
44883::$$$message_0394_0000_0038$$$::"...They are both natural airheads. They might form an equally silly couple."::
44884::$$$message_0394_0000_0039$$$::"That's right, people I don't really know. Saber and I are soulmates, and I won't let anyone get in the way of that."::
44885::$$$message_0394_0000_0040$$$::"Actually...I don't need any of you here. I'll feed you all to the Greater Grail when I'm finished."::
44887::$$$message_0394_0000_0042$$$::"...! So everyone looks all dead-eyed because of you!"::
44889::$$$message_0394_0000_0044$$$::"That's right. I had nothing better to do while I was waiting for Saber, so I took over Fuyuki. We need a lot of guests to come to our wedding, anyway."::
44890::$$$message_0394_0000_0045$$$::"I'll turn them all into zombies afterward, of course."::
44891::$$$message_0394_0000_0046$$$::"Ngh... I can't just let her do whatever she wants... I feel bad for her, but her very existence is evil..."::
44892::$$$message_0394_0000_0047$$$::"Saber, Lancer, Archer! Let's go! This time, I'm putting my family shame to rest for good!"::
44893::$$$message_0394_0000_0048$$$::"Hehehe. Okay. Welcome to my world, you little nuisance. I'll kill some time with[line len=2][wvl canskip=false time=200][hfchance layer=0][hffgchg2 chara=愛歌 face=ジト目 pos=left time=400 twno=1][hfsweat layer=0 ox=0 oy=0]Huh? Family? You are? Even though you have such a plain design?"::
44894::$$$message_0394_0000_0049$$$::"Oh, gimme a break. You don't even recognize me!? [wvl][hfwww layer=1]How self-centered [font italic=true]are[font italic=false] you, big sister!?"::

